      "type": "text",
      "text": "7 est\n\nIt’s Race Day at Auto Club Speedway, but a-lot of the drivers still have Texas on their minds. Old grudges, unfinished business, and plenty of bad blood have followed them all the way to California.",
      "message_id": "1541040274141225031"
    },
