      "type": "text",
      "text": "7:15 est\n\n<@810534889610674196>  can tell right away that the Texas drama didn’t stay in Texas. The drivers have brought every grudge, argument, and piece of unfinished business with them to Auto Club Speedway.\n\nSo Tommy makes a call to a friend… who calls a friend… who happens to know the one man who might actually be able to settle this mess: Drew Carey. Tommy explains what’s going on and asks Drew if he can help get everyone back under control.\n\nDrew’s response is simple:\n\n“We’re already packed up. See you soon.”",
      "message_id": "1541042894650220565"
    },
