    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Who will be the last driver standing?",
      "message_id": "1541178764417957948"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "images/055.png",
      "alt": "Adventure illustration"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "And the bell rings",
      "message_id": "1541182193043505284"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "images/056.png",
      "alt": "Adventure illustration"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Everyone is beating the hell out of each other to the point where everyone is down for the count. <@920731107257876501> is starting to get up when…..omg The Rock is here!",
      "message_id": "1541191010493927616"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "images/057.png",
      "alt": "Adventure illustration"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "images/058.png",
      "alt": "Adventure illustration"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Rock Bottom to <@920731107257876501> everyone is down again",
      "message_id": "1541204639674802308"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "images/059.png",
      "alt": "Adventure illustration"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Omg, <@603009327044755487> takes the brand new guitar he just won and hits the Rock over the head with it……but wait a minute, there’s <@762884028612739082>, <@762884028612739082> with the wet willy from behind. Down goes McKinney and the bell rings!!",
      "message_id": "1541213430843838544"
    },
